#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:74
msgid ""
"The paper describes two broad stages. During early training, layers "
"primarily move upward as they acquire label information. Later, several "
"intermediate and deep layers move left as the binned estimate of input "
"information decreases. Figure 3 also compares how the amount of training "
"data changes the final position of the deepest representation."
msgstr ""
"论文描述了两个大致阶段。训练早期，各层在获得标签信息时主要向上移动。随后，若干中间层和深层会随分箱输入信息估计值下降而向左移动。Figure 3 "
"还比较了训练数据量如何改变最深层表示的最终位置。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:80
msgid "This reproduction checks three observable claims:"
msgstr "本复现检验三个可观测主张："

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:82
msgid "the three training fractions produce the same broad trajectory direction;"
msgstr "三种训练比例是否产生相同的大致轨迹方向；"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:83
msgid "later layers exhibit a measurable decrease in binned $I(X;T)$; and"
msgstr "后续层的分箱 $I(X;T)$ 是否出现可测量的下降；以及"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:84
msgid "final deep-layer $I(T;Y)$ rises from the 5% panel to the 85% panel."
msgstr "最终深层的 $I(T;Y)$ 是否从 5% 面板到 85% 面板逐步上升。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:86
msgid "Paper Experiment and Reproduction Boundary"
msgstr "论文实验与复现边界"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/information-bottleneck-figure3.md:88
msgid ""
"The formal batch run follows the target figure's architecture, three "
"sample fractions, 10,000-epoch horizon, 50 independent initializations "
"and training subsets, and the released IDNNs binning convention. Where "
"the paper prose, figure caption, and public code differ, the architecture"
" and training horizon follow the target figure. Optimizer and "
"initialization details follow the executable public implementation."
msgstr ""
"正式批量运行遵循目标图的架构、三种样本比例、10,000 个 epoch 的训练周期、50 次独立初始化与训练子集，以及公开 IDNNs "
"的分箱约定。论文正文、图注和公开代码不一致时，架构与训练周期以目标图为准；优化器和初始化细节则以可执行的公开实现为准。"

